  "body": "@lampholder is not seeing self-signing keys when calling `/keys/query` on his homeserver for neilj who's on matrix.org. This seems to happen only for this user (neilj), but is 100% reproducable. The master key is the correct one, with `\"self_signing_keys\": {}` at the end. Tom says he's running `1.12.3`, I've asked him to repro on `1.12.4`, but already wanted to report here as 1.12.4 apparently only contained fixes for workerized instances, which is not the case for Tom.\r\n\r\nExact output returned from the CS-API can be found at https://github.com/matrix-org/riot-web-rageshakes/issues/2658\r\n\r\nThis causes breakage in Riot as even after verifying somebody, they still appear with a red shield, as trust chain to their devices is incomplete.",
